OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA sunny end
OL,6,Fto the day for Shetland but showers
OL,7,Fover Orkney will spread there later.
OL,8,FIt will stay showery overnight, the
OL,9,Fshowers heavy and frequent at times.
OL,10,FWinds will strengthen from the
OL,11,Fsouthwest.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FBright spells and showers, the
OL,14,Fshowers heavy and frequent at times.
OL,15,FThe west or southwest winds will
OL,16,Fbecome strong to gale force across
OL,17,FOrkney, lighter and more variable in
OL,18,FShetland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
