OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,6,Fwith showers and easing winds on
OL,7,FSaturday. Windy with showers on
OL,8,FSunday. Further showers and easing
OL,9,Fwinds on Monday.
